{
 "$comment": "Segments of one full circle: n = min(maxSegments, max(minSegments, ceil(pi / acos(1 - chordM / radiusM)), round.segments when radiusM > round.radiusM)). Each case is a cylinder of that radius about the Y axis.",
 "cases": [
  {
